m so funny enough these two  characters came inches away from each  other without ever knowing it another  Easter Egg that's worth mentioning is  the one that appears in the background  during the scene where Hank is holding  Dory in a plastic cup if you pause this  shot you'll see a wall-e calendar nailed  on to the lower right corner of the  screen stick around to find out which  other finding Dory Easter eggs defies  the laws of logic inside out and the  birds on the wire inside out is a  brilliant movie that gives us a bird's  eye view on what's happening inside of  the body when a young girl named Riley  moves away from her hometown she has a  hard time getting accustomed to her new  life as Riley enters her teenage years  her emotions start to get out of whack  causing joy to leave the building inside  out is an oscar-winning movie that  teaches children about their emotions  much like the Disney classics that came  before it inside out is no stranger when  it comes to Easter eggs however some of  them are so subtle that they might as  well not exist do any of you remember  the short animation for the birds that  Disney released in the year of 2000 well  if you do you might be one of the few  people who were able to spot out this  cameo Disney animators didn't waste any  time placing Easter eggs in inside outs  basket which is why these birds are  showcased right off the bat  while Riley and her parents are driving  to San Francisco the flock of birds from  the short animation  be spotted hanging out on a telephone  wire if this is your first time noticing  them make sure to leave a bird emoji in  the comments below  monsters Inc and the woody stickers  monsters Inc is a disney film that has  no shortage of Toy Story references in  fact there's so many of them present  that it's hard not to notice them so  knowing this we're going to show you an  easter egg that few fans stumble upon  due to how quickly it flashes across the  screen in monsters ink we see thou